// Open flow only.  The defaults are the desktop core's PLL pins for these two
// PLLs (fpga/desktop/desktop.cst), so the open test core places its HDMI clock
// chain where the desktop core does; tools/build_hdmi_test.sh substitutes
// other sites from HDMI_TEST_PLL27_SITE and HDMI_TEST_PLLHDMI_SITE.  The Gowin
// build of this core leaves placement to the vendor.
INS_LOC "pll_27.PLL_inst"   @PLL27_SITE@;
INS_LOC "pll_hdmi.PLL_inst" @PLLHDMI_SITE@;
